window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Get all your alien dragon shifter bad boy needs in this one delicious box set containing:<br> <br> DRACO<br> DRAXX<br> DREGA<br> DAEOS<br> DRASUS<br> DRELIX<br> <br> Six full length novels filled with dragon shifters finding their fated mates. Expect growls, snarls, plenty of 'mine', along with action and adventure in a dangerous prison maze. So many tropes I can only mention a few — forced proximity, only one bed, he falls first, enemies to lovers, new to mating MMC's and everything you love!<br> <br> Plus, as an added bonus — the Christmas novella GRUMPY DRAGON CHRISTMAS is included in this set!</p>"; 
